{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/panaramafire.gif?t=1745883583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cirrata is a rogue-lite, metroidvania inspired, action-platformer.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a red panda named Kier. In it's own unique way Cirrata will bring together aspects from beloved games like Dead Cells, and Castlevania SotN. You were once a chef. You are armed with your always dependable chef knife. After a long slumber you begin to explore a very unfamiliar world... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/steamgif3sm.gif?t=1745883583\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for provisions and fuel for the fires in the kitchen. Supply the chefs with this and be rewarded with the nourishment needed to fight. Each meal has its own unique effect on you. Combine these abilities in your own way to overcome large scale encounters and acquire unique weapons and loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/steamgif1sm.gif?t=1745883583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Find a bar run by frogs and use it as a central hub for your adventures. This bar will grow with you as you increase in power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Collect ingredients as you explore and fight enemies. Use this to supply the kitchen and receive new items or use as currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Combine different powers from consuming different foods (up to 5 at a time) either found in the world or created for you by chefs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Find and collect many different chef tools to use as a secondary weapon. Each with 3 levels of attack: Regular, Enhanced and Ultimate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Defeat elite enemies, mini-bosses, and large scale boss encounters to gain abilities, new weapons and ultimately become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/steamgif2sm.gif?t=1745883583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planned to come to early access in 2025. Please wish-list to support the development of Cirrata!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/steamgif4sm.gif?t=1745883583\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1183270?t=1745883583","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745883583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745883583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745883583","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/panaramafire.gif?t=1745883583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cirrata is a rogue-lite, metroidvania inspired, action-platformer.</h2><p c